Project Title: LegalEase – AI Legal Document Generator
Project Idea: Develop an AI-powered application that generates structured legal documents.
Problem Statement: Preparing legal documents manually can be time-consuming and difficult for users who are unfamiliar with legal document formats.
Proposed Solution: Create a web application that helps users generate draft legal documents using artificial intelligence.
Objectives:
Generate legal document drafts quickly.
Provide structured documents with relevant clauses.
Allow users to download generated documents.
Expected Outcome: A functional web application that assists users in preparing legal document drafts.  
